Package: fastMR
Title: Exact and Fast Summary-Statistics Mendelian Randomization
Version: 0.1.5
Date: 2026-08-02
Authors@R: person("Fergus", "Hamilton", email = "fergushamilton@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Fergus Hamilton [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Fergus Hamilton <fergushamilton@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Exact summary-statistics Mendelian randomization methods with a
    registered C++ shared-grid backend. The package provides a small,
    dependency-light R interface for TwoSampleMR-style tidy data, including
    local harmonisation, LD clumping, and optional Arrow Parquet input.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/gushamilton/fastMR
